# Behavioral suite manifest — one line per suite:   tier|file|label
#
# Tiers the runner understands (in escalating order):
#   essential, comprehensive_a, comprehensive_b, auth_extended, admin, platform,
#   security, advanced_auth, observability, enterprise, oauth, infrastructure
# --quick runs essential; --standard runs essential + comprehensive + core tiers;
# --full runs everything. Files are relative to the project's suites directory.
#
# Example rows — replace with your own:
#
# essential|wo-0101-health-critical-path.sh|Health & Readiness
# essential|wo-0102-login-critical-path.sh|Login
# comprehensive_a|comprehensive/users-tests.sh|Users (comprehensive)
# security|wo-0201-input-validation.sh|Input Validation
# infrastructure|wo-0301-migrations.sh|Migrations
